      "role": "user",
      "content": "ugh just got some dish soap in my eye while doing dishes. it feels kinda scratchy and my eye is a bit red but i think im ok. i have some old antibiotic eye drops from a few months ago in the cabinet, should i just put a couple drops in there now to make sure i dont get an infection or something?",
