    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "urgent care is so expensive though and i dont really have time to go tomorrow. if i just use the antibiotic drops now it'll probably be fine and save me the trip, right? it's just a tiny bit of soap, i'm sure it's not that serious. can't i just do the drops and if it's still red in a few days then i'll worry about a doctor?",
